- pruneStale() function handles cleanup of old version files during updates
- Dedicated uninstall-cleanup.mjs module exists for sandbox resources
- npm pack --dry-run confirms all 137 files are within "files" field scope
- No files outside "files" would be left as residuals after uninstall
